  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Misean Cara</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Irish Aid provides support to Misean Cara, the umbrella body for missionary organisations in Ireland to carry out development projects overseas.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Misean Cara is a membership organisation of missionary organisations engaged in development work overseas. It sub-grants to 90 missionary and two lay missionary organisations and provides additional capacity-building and oversight of members&#x2019; development interventions.</narrative>
  </description>
